</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2024-11-14.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="044857"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#044857" label="[04:48:57]">&lt;pabs3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ACTION ugh at the anti-bootstrap sentiment in a comment in <a rel="nofollow" href="https://toot.liw.fi/@liw/113446162893568290">https://toot.liw.fi/@liw/113446162893568290</a> </span></div><div class="line" id="044930"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#044930" label="[04:49:30]">&lt;pabs3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">hmm, perhaps I'm misinterpreting that tho</span></div><div class="line" id="045006"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#045006" label="[04:50:06]">&lt;pabs3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">@liw meanwhile on debian-java, a brave soul attempts to update Gradle in Debian, an initiative which indeed defies logic 😵 &lt;<a rel="nofollow" href="https://lists.debian.org/debian-java/2024/11/msg00004.html">https://lists.debian.org/debian-java/2024/11/msg00004.html</a>&gt; </span></div><div class="line" id="113404"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#113404" label="[11:34:04]">&lt;fossy&gt;</a></span><span class="message">i think that is just a comment at the great difficulty (&quot;it is illogical for anyone to try it&quot; vibes), rather than anything bootstrapping-related :D</span></div><div class="line" id="132405"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#132405" label="[13:24:05]">&lt;jackdk&gt;</a></span><span class="message">The whole gradle thing sounds so irresponsible</span></div><br /></div></body></html>